                : "Trady uses full-window population deviation and decimal input/output conversion. Object, generic, and tuple routes are verified for finite inputs. WindowDispersion publishes available-history statistics, with comparisons aligned to Trady's first full window. Period one is supported; exact moments preserve small differences and finite results across oversized intermediate variance.";
        if (api.Id == "Skender.GetStdDev")
