        if (api.Id == "Skender.GetSmaAnalysis")
            limitation = "All four outputs and presence flags are verified: SMA, absolute error, squared error, and average abs(price-SMA)/price. Errors use the published rounded mean, so squared error can differ from unrounded-center population variance. Relative denominators retain their sign, with no factor of 100; any zero price makes only that field absent. Exact Ooples ratios preserve cancellation across individually overflowing terms. Native quote conversion and binary64 stages have separate references, with quote/tuple/chained route regressions. Full-window startup, period one, lazy maximum periods, and unrepresentable published-output rejection are covered.";
        if (api.Id == "Skender.GetDonchian")
