                : "Trady uses period current-inclusive candles and the newest equal extreme. Decimal Up and Down are rounded separately; the oscillator subtracts those published decimal components. WindowAroon(period,false) uses the same window/tie rules with exact percentage ratios and rounds the oscillator independently. Object/tuple routes and the publicly constructible generic oscillator route are verified. Full outputs/presence, startup, tie expiration, signed/extreme prices, and lazy maximum periods have independent references.";
